WEBVTT

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:39.320
<i>This sucks...</i>

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:42.620
<i>Yah, all we ever do is keep watch...</i>

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:45.720
<i>We done up and left the boonies
cuz of all that fancy talk,</i>

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:50.250
<i>but all we do is weasel around,
ain't even no shootouts...</i>

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.500
<i>What is it?!</i>

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.200
<i>There was a kid...</i>

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:03.840
<i>A kid?! Yeah, like there'd really
be one in this ol' scrapheap!</i>

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:05.480
<i>No, really!</i>

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:10.350
<i>Wait, you!</i>

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.510
<i>You clod! Don't leave yer post!</i>

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:16.620
<i>Sheesh...</i>

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:41.090
<i>How much longer?</i>

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:43.650
<i>Take it easy...</i>

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:44.820
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:49.380
<i>We'll be filthy rich
once the sun shows its face!</i>

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:52.040
<i>Hey...</i>

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:57.300
<i>Sorry! Were we too loud, Shimada-san?</i>

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:00.970
<i>Isn't it time to change shifts?</i>

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:02.900
<i>It's time already?!</i>

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:06.460
<i>- Come on, quit spazzin' out!
- Shaddup!</i>

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:09.790
<i>She hasn't eaten?</i>

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:15.070
<i>Nope. Won't even give me the time of day,
after all my generosity...</i>

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:19.520
<i>She probably only eats fancy stuff...</i>

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.140
<i>Dammit...</i>

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.290
<i>What a hardnosed brat.</i>

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:29.830
<i>If you want I can force it down her throat.</i>

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:30.760
<i>Forget about it.</i>

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:34.560
<i>We'll be done babysitting once
our client shows up in the morning.</i>

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:39.540
<i>I bet this kid's
gonna be worth lots again!</i>

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:42.930
<i>Way more than what
we're gettin' paid!</i>

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:47.570
<i>Don't stick your nose where it
don't belong. It'll only get you hurt.</i>

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:53.320
<i>Just focus on your own job...</i>

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:55.260
<i>Someone come here!</i>

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:57.860
<i>Wait! You stay here!</i>

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.510
<i>What the?</i>

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.780
<i>Who the hell could've.</i>

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:06.780
<i>They alive?</i>

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:10.610
<i>Y-yes! They're just unconscious!</i>

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:12.880
<i>How odd...</i>

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:16.450
<i>Why not just kill 'em
and throw 'em outta sight?</i>

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:19.660
<i>Why do something this obvious?</i>

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:20.860
<i>Oh, shit!</i>

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:25.090
<i>We've been had!</i>

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:27.260
<i>Come on! Get up!</i>

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:33.740
<i>There were guards posted
all around the room... so how?</i>

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:36.640
<i>S-sorry!</i>

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:39.470
<i>I was suddenly attacked from above...</i>

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:41.640
<i>Above?!</i>

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.380
<i>I see...</i>

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:51.290
<i>Tell everyone to secure the exits!
Don't let 'em escape!</i>

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:52.520
<i>Right!</i>

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.120
<i>You three come with me!</i>

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.320
<i>We're going rat-hunting!</i>

00:04:57.320 --> 00:05:02.630
<i>Swiping prey from
kidnapping professionals...</i>

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:06.050
<i>I gotta say, that's pretty gutsy...</i>

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:08.790
That was close!

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:16.090
Old ''Night Mist'' Shimada is
definitely one hell of a kidnapper!

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:20.150
He reacts quick!
Can't let my guard down!

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:24.120
Hey, quit actin' up!

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.860
Hey, Kosuna! You read me?

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.460
<i>I'm here.</i>

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:28.490
Change of plans.

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:31.660
Switch from Operation Cyclone
to Operation Hurricane! Hurry!

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:35.060
<i>Eh?! I was in the
middle of getting it ready...!</i>

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.470
Quit complaining! Just do it!

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:39.800
<i>Fine...</i>

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:44.530
You're safe now, little girl!
You must've been scared...

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:51.590
Not only did they tie you up,
they even gagged you!

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:53.360
You poor thing...

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:55.630
<i>Why, you!</i>

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:59.760
<i>- I don't need your help!</i>

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:59.760
- W-what?!

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:00.720
Huh?!

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:05.430
<i>Daddy hired you to save me, right?!</i>

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:08.340
Y-yes, that's right...

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:09.700
<i>Unbelievable!</i>

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:14.170
<i>What if you had screwed up
and I got caught in a shootout?!</i>

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:18.730
<i>This could all end quietly
if he would just pay the ransom!</i>

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:23.010
<i>And look! My favorite
outfit is all filthy!</i>

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:26.780
<i>I'll have you know that
this was VERY expensive!</i>

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.350
Y-you know...

00:06:29.350 --> 00:06:32.400
<i>We're going to have to walk now, right?</i>

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:35.220
- Umm, little girl...

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:35.220
<i>- I really don't like walking!</i>

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:39.400
<i>I'm starving, and I don't want to walk!</i>

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:42.690
Listen when people are talking!

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:48.200
Yeesh...

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:52.660
This's what I get for being nice,
even if you are my client's daughter...

00:06:54.390 --> 00:07:00.320
You know, little girl,
this isn't about those guys' ransom.

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:02.420
<i>What do you mean?</i>

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:07.520
Those guys're professional
kidnappers that people hire.

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:11.760
<i>Eh? I don't really understand...</i>

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:16.330
Umm, your old man, he pulled
some dirty tricks a while back

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.260
to crush a rival company.

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:24.630
These guys' client was
the owner of that company.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:30.880
So basically, this isn't about money.
It's about revenge and payback.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:34.650
His goal is to make
your old man suffer...

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:40.290
Damn! You got no idea
what's going on, do you?!

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:45.860
<i>Basically paying the ransom won't
automatically guarantee your safety!</i>

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.730
<i>It won't?</i>

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.730
I wouldn't be too surprised
if you do get killed.

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:52.330
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.700
But I'd choose death if I were you!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:59.330
Sleazy rich guys very often like to...

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:04.500
...to satisfy themselves!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.580
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:10.450
That scared her! Serves her right!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:13.590
<i>Is that because I'm so adorable?!</i>

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:14.590
Huh?

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:22.600
<i>Yeah! I'm quite a beautiful little girl,
if I do say so myself!</i>

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:25.300
<i>Maybe it's because I'm so well-bred?</i>

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:30.110
<i>I guess even criminals
can appreciate that fact!</i>

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.990
Oh, geez!

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:36.050
Anyways! We gotta get outta here!
Understand?!

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:41.470
<i>Yes, but I don't like dirt
or pain or being tired!</i>

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:45.760
I hate this girl...

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:50.130
They did notice...

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.300
<i>W-what?</i>

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.930
Just come on! We're gettin' outta here!

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.300
<i>Wait!</i>

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:58.070
<i>Found 'em! Floor 13, B-Point!</i>

00:08:58.070 --> 00:08:59.980
<i>As I predicted...</i>

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:03.470
<i>Alright, tell everyone it's a ''Rat Hunt''.</i>

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:04.800
<i>Understood!</i>

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:11.700
<i>How amusing! It's been a while
since I was this excited!</i>

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:36.290
Nice. They're closing in slowly
and calmly from all directions...

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:37.500
<i>Hey!</i>

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:39.420
They're showing no confusion...

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:40.330
<i>Hey!</i>

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.950
Do they know this building's layout?

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:44.210
<i>Hey! Hey!</i>

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:48.950
This is bad! If they have
the home-court advantage, then...

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.520
<i>I said hey!</i>

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.890
What do you want?!

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:54.720
<i>I'm tired!</i>

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:57.730
We haven't even walked
for five minutes!

00:09:57.730 --> 00:10:00.260
<i>I can't walk another step!</i>

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:02.820
Urgh! Come on, get up!

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:05.400
<i>I don't wanna!</i>

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:08.120
You dummy! I said don't act up!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:12.440
<i>I said I don't wanna!</i>

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:15.380
I hate this kid!

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:20.650
Anyways, the escape route I planned
to use is completely blocked off...

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:21.620
Kosuna!

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:22.480
You copy?

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:24.950
<i>Y-yes, Kosuna here!</i>

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:29.760
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:35.000
Oh, I was just thinking how you
seemed nice and friendly for once!

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.000
<i>Eh?</i>

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:41.140
Never mind. Operation Hurricane
is cancelled! Switch to Monsoon!

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:45.040
<i>Again?! After all I did?!</i>

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:49.170
Don't blame me! Plans hafta be flexible!
Be quick about it!

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:54.950
OK, let's move!

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:58.150
Come on...

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:01.190
What? Gonna whine some more?

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:03.430
<i>...to...</i>

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:04.960
Huh?!

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:07.430
<i>...want to!</i>

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:09.470
I can't hear you.

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:12.230
<i>...want to use!</i>

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:15.570
Huh?! Speak normal!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.770
<i>Are you trying to embarrass a lady!</i>

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:19.840
<i>I said I wanna use the restroom!</i>

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:24.110
Oh, you gotta pee?
You shoulda just said so.

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:25.890
<i>You're despicable!</i>

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:29.730
<i>- I can't!</i>

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:29.730
- Just hold it.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:32.760
Then do it right there. I'll stand guard.

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:34.520
<i>I can't do that!</i>

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:36.630
You lousy kid!

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:38.830
<i>I'll go do it around the corner!</i>

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:41.880
Wait! Don't go off by yourself!

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:45.570
<i>Peek and I'll tell Daddy on you!</i>

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:51.820
Ugh...

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:02.610
Where is she?

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:05.150
I should probably check.

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:08.060
No, she could catch me
and cause a scene...

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:10.890
Plus it'd be a pain if they spotted us...

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:14.010
If rumor gets out I watched
a kid going to the bathroom

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:18.170
what'll Junko and the
Kawaguchi brothers say?!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.860
But still!

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:22.840
Hey, Kosuna...

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:27.480
<i>Yes... W-what is it?
Another change of plan?!</i>

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:30.300
No, I got a quick question...

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:31.550
<i>What is it?</i>

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:36.140
About how long does it
normally take a girl to pee?

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:42.610
What the heck am I doing?

00:12:45.930 --> 00:12:49.100
No, I'm not into that sorta thing!

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:53.000
I have no choice, given the situation!
The brat hasn't come back!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:56.130
So I'm concerned... Yeah, I'm worried!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:13:02.610
I'm not a pervert!
Not a pervert! NOT a pervert!

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:07.800
Where the heck IS she?

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:10.540
Hey, kid!

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:17.460
I'm coming over.

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:20.960
Just so you know,
I'm not into that sort of thing!

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:25.300
I'm simply fulfilling the terms
of the contract that my employer.

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.070
<i>Hiya!</i>

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.630
<i>So sorry...</i>

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:41.650
<i>Shimada-san knows this
building inside and out.</i>

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:46.230
<i>So all we hafta do is do what he says.</i>

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:51.540
So you sat back and waited
until she was all alone?!

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:54.860
<i>Yup. This here girl's our money train.</i>

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:57.630
<i>We couldn't let her
get caught in a fight...</i>

00:13:57.630 --> 00:14:00.900
<i>Now to pay you back for earlier!</i>

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:08.540
<i>What'll it be? Get shot to death? Or...</i>

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.250
<i>...will you jump right off?!</i>

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:19.800
There's five of 'em...
This'll be tough...

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:23.290
They know more about the
building's layout than me,

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:27.080
so they can easily corner me if I run off.

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:29.600
So what do I do?

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.830
It's worth a shot!

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.090
What the hell're you.

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:41.420
<i>What's that?!</i>

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:44.460
<i>Crap! It's blinded our night-scopes!</i>

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:46.860
<i>Damn! I can't see!</i>

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:55.990
<i>Where are they?!</i>

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:02.760
<i>It's dark and crowded and dirty!</i>

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:04.630
Quit shouting!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.130
OK! Here we go!

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:09.380
<i>Aah! Don't touch me there!</i>

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.940
D-don't be smearing my good name!

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:15.740
<i>You're terrible! I've never
even let Daddy touch me!</i>

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:17.210
<i>I found 'em!</i>

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.880
<i>Over here!</i>

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:23.200
<i>You idiot! What if you hit the kid?!</i>

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.630
<i>Ow!</i>

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:33.480
<i>Look! My hair is covered
in dirt all thanks to you!</i>

00:15:33.480 --> 00:15:36.060
<i>And what kind of rescue was that?!</i>

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:42.070
<i>What if your violent actions
had marred my beautiful face?!</i>

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:46.510
<i>My face is worth way
much more than yours!</i>

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:53.000
<i>Your ugly face isn't even worth
one of my eyelashes! Got that?!</i>

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:57.040
<i>- I haven't seen your face, though!</i>

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:57.040
- You're just some sleazeball's kid!

00:15:58.320 --> 00:16:01.660
<i>Daddy's gonna be SO mad
when he hears that!</i>

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:04.790
Let's keep this a secret
from Daddy, okay?

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:08.730
Damn... They've already caught up!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:12.140
And we can't use the
ventilation shaft now...

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:14.790
You read me, Kosuna?!

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:18.070
<i>I'm here. More bathroom talk?</i>

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:20.310
No! This is about the plan!

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:25.240
<i>Don't worry! Operation Monsoon
is proceeding smoothly!</i>

00:16:25.240 --> 00:16:29.650
Monsoon is cancelled too!
Switch to Operation Phoenix!

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.620
<i>Are you doing this on purpose?</i>

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:36.160
Shut up! Just do what I say!
Operation Phoenix! Got that?!

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:37.990
<i>Yes, sir...</i>

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:42.200
<i>There they are!
Don't let 'em escape this time!</i>

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:43.480
<i>Request backup!</i>

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:54.270
<i>- They're headed your way!
- Alright! Surround 'em!</i>

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:56.410
<i>Checkmate...</i>

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.450
<i>You put up quite a fight...</i>

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:05.190
<i>You seemed pretty good, but looks
like you were a real amateur...</i>

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:10.090
<i>Escaping upwards was practically
cutting off your own retreat!</i>

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:13.150
<i>H-he couldn't be!</i>

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:15.720
<i>I can't run anymore!</i>

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:20.980
You idiot! Do you wanna be
a greasy old man's plaything?!

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:25.220
<i>But I really can't!</i>

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:26.160
<i>This way!</i>

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:28.980
There's about 10 total, I guess...

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.140
OK!

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:34.880
<i>Don't lose 'em!</i>

00:17:36.390 --> 00:17:38.420
<i>A smoke bomb!</i>

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:41.460
<i>Ignore it! Charge!</i>

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.420
<i>Wait! That's!</i>

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:47.360
<i>Alright! We gotcha now!</i>

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:50.700
<i>W-what the?!</i>

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:58.870
Let's watch our step
when we're in a hurry!

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:05.550
Finally made it!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.180
<i>We made it to the roof!</i>

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:12.230
Kosuna! Where are you?!
Did you get everything set?!

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:15.950
<i>Yo...</i>

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:19.190
<i>I thought you seemed cheeky,</i>

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:21.990
<i>but I had no idea you were
THE Sunabouzu handyman...</i>

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:25.100
<i>Handyman?! I THOUGHT you seemed lame!</i>

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:30.470
<i>Daddy should've paid
for some REAL help! Honestly!</i>

00:18:30.470 --> 00:18:33.210
Nice to meet you,
''Night Mist'' Shimada-san...

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.580
I've heard all about you...

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:40.140
<i>I know we just met and all,
but what do you say we end this?</i>

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:45.390
Yes, let's...

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:46.140
<i>What?!</i>

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:50.490
Drop your guns or the hostage gets it!

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:53.630
<i>Damn you, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:56.540
She's important merchandise, right?

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:59.240
If you don't want her damaged
then leave me alive!

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.590
Do that and I'll return the girl!

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:06.440
<i>U-unbelievable!
Daddy is going to kill you!</i>

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:11.910
Shove it, kid! He'll never know
if I just say I was too late!

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:13.020
<i>You're despicable!</i>

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:16.750
I'll make sure I do get my fee, though!

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.260
<i>He's horrible...</i>

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.530
<i>The rumors were true, Sunabouzu.</i>

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:26.940
<i>You're a cowardly,
helpless piece of trash!</i>

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:28.890
Look who's talkin'.

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:32.270
<i>If you wanna kill her, then kill her.</i>

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:33.600
What?

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:38.710
<i>It doesn't matter to our trade
whether she's dead or alive.</i>

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:42.810
<i>Though I guess she'd be
worth a little less as a corpse...</i>

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:48.580
<i>I refuse to let an asshole
like you have your way...</i>

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.390
Yeah?

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:51.120
In that case...

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:54.150
...how about I make sure
there's no corpse left?!

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:07.890
Kosuna! You're late!

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:15.180
<i>He had help?!</i>

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:18.180
Ugh! Commence Operation Phoenix!

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:20.320
<i>R-Roger!</i>

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.420
<i>W-what the?!</i>

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:23.420
<i>What have you done?!</i>

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:26.250
I-isn't this a little TOO intense?!

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:31.790
<i>Eh?! I set it up just like you said!
Two things of TNT in 10 spots!</i>

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:37.450
Y-you imbecile! That's Operation Tornado!
I said Operation Phoenix!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:54.270
<i>That was close!
Saved in the nick of time!</i>

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:58.590
<i>Handymen must be pretty awesome
if they have stuff like this!</i>

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:00.400
<i>I guess...</i>

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:03.430
<i>But the situation
isn't quite that good...</i>

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:09.340
<i>We're over the weight limit
and losing altitude fast!</i>

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:10.370
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:14.540
You have some nerve! Get off, you!

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:19.980
<i>Screw you! You went too far!
I had no idea you had help!</i>

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:25.230
Surprised?! The best are always
two or three steps ahead!

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:28.090
<i>Ha! You screwed up plenty at the end!</i>

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.080
Say what?!

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:31.130
<i>Hey, stop shaking it!</i>

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:34.940
- What do you think you're...

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:34.940
<i>- Damn you! You're a dead man!</i>

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:37.770
<i>Quit shaking it! We're falling!</i>

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:44.630
<i>M-Master!</i>

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:46.170
<i>We're flying!</i>

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:49.340
<i>And so the girl was safely rescued</i>

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:52.030
<i>from the hands of
the terrible kidnappers...</i>

00:21:57.180 --> 00:21:59.350
<i>Are you all right, Master?</i>

00:22:00.120 --> 00:22:06.620
<i>I made sure I got my share of
our earnings before it got pocketed.</i>

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:09.540
<i>This is all you get...</i>

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:12.360
<i>Well, I have work to do!</i>

00:23:55.070 --> 00:23:56.780
<i>Yo! Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu here!</i>

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:00.680
<i>- Don't worry! I'II have one in 5 years!</i>

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:00.680
<i>- Why's it all flat chests lately?!</i>

00:24:00.680 --> 00:24:01.710
<i>So will I!</i>

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:03.680
<i>- Mine'll be bigger!
- Will not!</i>

00:24:03.720 --> 00:24:05.510
<i>Five years?! I need boobies NOW!</i>

00:24:05.510 --> 00:24:07.570
<i>On the next Sunabouzu-
''Ideality and Reality''</i>

00:24:07.570 --> 00:24:09.670
<i>Miss it and it'll be no-boob city!</i>
